shu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0357","quote":"起家秘書郎，征西將軍庾亮請為參軍，累遷長史。亮臨薨，上疏稱羲之清貴有鑒裁。遷甯遠將軍、江州刺史。羲之既少有美譽，朝廷公卿皆愛其才器，頻召為侍中、吏部尚書，皆不就。復授護軍將軍，又推遷不拜。揚州刺史殷浩素雅重之，勸使應命，乃遺羲之書曰：「悠悠者以足下出處足觀政之隆替，如吾等亦謂為然。至如足下出處，正與隆替對，豈可以一世之存亡，必從足下從容之適？幸徐求眾心。卿不時起，復可以求美政不？若豁然開懷，當知萬物之情也。」羲之遂報書曰：「吾素自無廊廟志，直王丞相時果欲內吾，誓不許之，手跡猶存，由來尚矣，不於足下參政而方進退。自兒娶女嫁，便懷尚子平之志，數與親知言之，非一日也。若蒙驅使，關隴、巴蜀皆所不辭。吾雖無專對之能，直謹守時命，宣國家威德，固當不同於凡使，必令遠近咸知朝廷留心於無外，此所益殊不同居護軍也。漢末使太傅馬日磾慰撫關東，若不以吾輕微，無所為疑，宜及初冬以行，吾惟恭以待命。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w080-line016-馬日磾〔東觀校書〕0:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016","start":355,"end":357,"surface":"太傅","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line016:m0357","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依本句所授、所歷或任時稱謂。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"t-wu056-t-wu056-zhuzhi5","person_id":"66n_s45_86s","kind":"office","title":"太傅","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-056","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi:line011","quote":"　　朱治字君理，丹楊故鄣人也。初為縣吏，後察孝廉，州辟從事，隨孫堅征伐。中平五年，拜司馬。從討長沙、零、桂等三郡賊周朝、蘇馬等。有功，堅表治行都尉。從破董卓於陽人，入洛陽。表治行督軍校尉，特將步騎，東助徐州牧陶謙討黃巾。會堅薨，治扶冀策，依就袁術。後知術政德不立，乃勸策還平江東。時太傅馬日碑在壽春，辟治為掾，遷吳郡都尉。是時吳景已在丹楊，而策為術攻廬江。於是劉繇恐為袁、孫所並，遂構嫌隙。而策家門盡在州下，治乃使人於曲阿迎太妃及權兄弟。所以供奉輔護，甚有恩紀。治從錢唐欲進到吳，吳郡太守許貢拒之於由拳，治與戰，大破之。貢南就山賊嚴自虎，治遂入郡，領太守事。策既走劉繇，東定會稽。權年十五，治舉為孝廉。後策薨，治與張昭等共尊奉權。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi:line011:m0143"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu056-t-wu056-zhuzhi5:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi:line011","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-056-zhuzhi:line011:m0143","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"太傅","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003","text":"嵗餘復徴拜議郎與諫議大夫馬日磾議郎蔡邕楊彪韓說等並在東觀校中書五經記傳補續漢記帝以非急務轉為侍中遷尚書","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"馬日磾","kind":"person","person_id":"66n_s45_86s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"蔡邕","kind":"person","person_id":"gs5_qqu_9ui","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"楊彪","kind":"person","person_id":"0c1_b9d_9c2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"韓說","kind":"person","person_id":"59s_8f3_irg","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-064-luzhi:p003:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"0wg_vtn_yqb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事及引語主客辨識；原字與來源層保留。"}],"source_position":{"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":290,"last_line":293,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/houhan064-luzhi/projection.json","editorial_paragraph_boundary":true,"first_page_id":"KR2a0009_WYG_094-16b","last_page_id":"KR2a0009_WYG_094-16b"